  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "陆公子，又来问账？行。问清楚些，我不替你补半句。",
      "emotion": "cold_smile",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "你为什么追着周德茂讨债？",
          "goto": "intro",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "码头上那句“别想走”，什么意思？",
          "goto": "ask_quarrel",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "shen_talked_once"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "min_hub_visits": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "船开以后，你回客栈了吗？",
          "goto": "ask_alibi",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "shen_talked_once"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "min_hub_visits": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "你和老范，只是认得脸？",
          "goto": "ask_fan_connection",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "shen_quarrel_told"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "沈父药账上差的银子，怎么补？",
          "goto": "ask_father",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "evidence": "evidence_father_ledger"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "码头那一刻钟，你去了哪里？",
          "goto": "press_dock_timing",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "clue": "evidence_dock_timing"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "浅滩的芦苇，你为什么知道？",
          "goto": "press_salvage",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "clue": "evidence_salvage_mark"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "老范说，找他的是药材行姑娘。",
          "goto": "press_connection",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "clue": "evidence_shen_connection"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "（对峙）沈姑娘，该把话摆到堂上了。",
          "goto": "confession_trigger",
          "type": "confrontation",
          "requires": {
            "all": [
              {
