    "intro": {
      "set_flags": [
        "shen_talked_once"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "周德茂欠我三十八两。前天我在码头拦过他，这事我不躲。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cooperative"
        },
        {
          "text": "你堵他，是为讨债。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        },
        {
          "text": "不然呢？药材行要周转，我爹等着钱抓药，账期到了，我不追，难道等大明律替我补这个窟窿？",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "sharp"
        },
        {
          "text": "可他死了……你一文也收不回来。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "可不是。人活着，账还能慢慢磨；人一沉江，欠条攥在手里也换不回银子。陆公子问吧，我也想知道是谁把我这笔生意一并搅黄了。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cooperative"
        },
        {
          "text": "她说得又快又直，句句都落在账上，不落在恨上。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "worried"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_quarrel": {
      "set_flags": [
        "shen_quarrel_told"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "我原话是，今天总得给我个准日子，不然这船他上得也不安稳。码头边卖茶的都听见了。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "sharp"
        },
        {
          "text": "这话听着……有点威胁的意思。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "讨债的话本来就不中听。我要是真想害他，会挑二十多双眼睛前先吵一场？",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "sharp"
        },
        {
          "text": "她答得好顺，一口气都没歇。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "worried"
        },
        {
          "text": "吵完之后呢？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "他说明早到武昌先兑银，三日内给我。说完就让阿贵搬箱子上船。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cooperative"
        },
        {
          "text": "你连阿贵搬箱子都留意到了。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "债主盯欠债人的箱子，不奇怪吧。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "sharp"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_alibi": {
      "set_flags": [
        "shen_alibi_told"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "船离岸后，我就回客栈了。那晚冷，我还让伙计送过热水。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cooperative",
          "record_type": "testimony",
          "record_title": "证词记录：沈清月的不在场证明",
          "record_text": "沈清月声称案发当夜看周德茂上船后即返回客栈休息。",
          "highlight": [
            "回客栈睡觉"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "伙计能给你作证吗？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "他若没睡熟，该能记得。记不得，也不能反过来说我没回。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "sharp"
        },
        {
          "text": "（她不肯给准时辰，只说让伙计去记……）",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        },
        {
          "text": "你说船离岸后就走了，这句我先记下。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_fan_connection": {
      "set_flags": [
        "shen_denied_fan"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "老范替我送过两回药箱。码头船家嘛，认得脸很平常。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cooperative"
        },
        {
          "text": "我问的不是送药，是私下有没有聊过别的？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "码头上说话不叫私下。问船价，问雨势，问哪条路快，这些谁都会问。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "deflecting"
        },
        {
          "text": "（她答得好快……）",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        },
        {
          "text": "老范欠赌债的事，你是从哪儿听来的？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "赌坊讨债能闹半条街，想不听见都难。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "sharp"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_father": {
      "set_flags": [
        "shen_father_asked"
      ],
      "gain_clue": "clue_shen_motive_calculation",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "她看见药账的一瞬间，指尖压住了袖口。只一下，很快又松开。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "八十两药钱。账上只剩四十二两。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "家里病人等药，铺子还要开门。我缺钱，不等于我会杀人。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cold_smile"
        },
        {
          "text": "周德茂欠你三十八两……刚好补这个缺。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "所以我更该让他活着还。死人不会拿银票出门。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "sharp"
        },
        {
          "text": "她这句接得快。可提到账上只剩四十二两时，她先按了袖口。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "determined"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "press_dock_timing": {
      "set_flags": [
        "shen_timing_cracked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "你说船离岸后就回了客栈。可有人看见，船开出去一刻钟，你还在码头。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        },
        {
          "text": "夜里雾重。高个子的女人，也不只我一个。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "deflecting"
        },
        {
          "text": "那人穿男装，站的位置，就是你先前堵周德茂的地方。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "债没讨到，我站一会儿吹风，不行吗？",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "sharp"
        },
        {
          "text": "她把回客栈，改成了站一会儿。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "determined"
        },
        {
          "text": "那……一会儿之后呢？往客栈，还是往下游？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "……往客栈。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cracking"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "press_salvage": {
      "set_flags": [
        "shen_salvage_pressed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "沈姑娘，天亮之前，下游浅滩留下来打捞的痕迹。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        },
        {
          "text": "……所以？跟我有什么关系？",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "sharp"
        },
        {
          "text": "浅滩芦苇新折，水边有长竿划痕，还有重物拖上岸又搬走的压痕。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "那片浅滩谁都能踩。江边不是沈家的后院。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "deflecting"
        },
        {
          "text": "你说你在睡觉。可那处痕迹只可能是天亮前留下的，你那晚的去向，正好缺了这一段。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        },
        {
          "text": "等等。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "我没说芦苇丛。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        },
        {
          "text": "……那一带草深。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cracking"
        },
        {
          "text": "她停了。只有一下。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "determined"
        },
        {
          "text": "石矶渡下游的浅滩，多数是泥滩。你去过那里，才知道长着芦苇。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        },
        {
          "text": "她嘴上说不是自己……可你看她的手，刚才还松着，现在死死扣着扶手。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "determined"
        },
        {
          "text": "（镖局走水路看漂痕，东西会往哪儿靠，可不是吹一夜风就能看明白的……）",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        },
        {
          "text": "我现在只问这一处：你怎么知道那片是芦苇，不是泥滩？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "press_connection": {
      "set_flags": [
        "shen_connection_pressed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "老范说了，找他的人是做药材的姑娘。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "soft"
        },
        {
          "text": "她脸上的笑一下收住了。过了一瞬，才又重新笑起来。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "他这样说了？有意思。赌鬼急了，逮谁都敢攀。陆公子也信？",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cold_fury"
        },
        {
          "text": "你把手放下来了。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "老范说找他的姑娘做药材。阿贵说有人教他凿船。你刚才听见这两句，把手放下来了。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        },
        {
          "text": "……",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cracking"
        },
        {
          "text": "沉默了整整五息。然后她慢慢地。把一直抱着的双臂放了下来。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "陆公子。你是来问话的，还是已经把判词写在袖子里了？",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cold_fury"
        },
        {
          "text": "她……怎么突然不笑了？",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "anxious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "react_agui_caught": {
      "text": "阿贵招了？……意料之中。他那种人，扛不住的。",
      "emotion": "cold_fury",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_father_after": {
      "text": "……还在躺着。八十两的药，一天不能断。",
      "emotion": "broken",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "confession_trigger": {
      "set_flags": [
        "shen_confrontation_triggered"
      ],
      "trigger_confrontation": true,
      "confrontation_key": "confrontation_final",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "沈姑娘，堂上说吧。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        },
        {
          "text": "老范的债，阿贵的浮囊，码头那一刻钟，下游浅滩的脚印，我都会一件件摆出来。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        },
        {
          "text": "她看了看门外。雨水顺着檐角滴下，半晌才落一滴。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "陆公子，问得倒细。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cold_smile"
        },
        {
          "text": "不过陆公子，县衙落笔，不靠你觉得我像。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cold_fury"
        },
        {
          "text": "她刚才看你的眼神，好冷。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "shocked"
        },
        {
          "text": "那就让她等着听完。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "gentle"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "开始对峙",
          "goto": "__confront__",
          "type": "confrontation"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
